### 8. Recommended Title Options

1. **"Start With the Problem, Not the Tool: The AI Strategy Most Enterprises Get Backwards"** -- Strongest. Direct, counterintuitive, practitioner-credible, and states the thesis in the title. Makes a CTO who's gone tool-first feel implicated.

2. **"Why 80% of AI Projects Are Net Negative (And How to Avoid Being One of Them)"** -- Strong hook, SEO-friendly, opens with the data point that will make a skeptical executive keep reading. Slightly less differentiated than option 1.

3. **"No, You Don't Have an AI Strategy. You Have an AI Wish List."** -- Most provocative. High click rate, higher bounce risk. Works better as a LinkedIn pull quote than a permanent URL.

